{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《商業內幕》報道，OpenAI CEO薩姆·奧特曼(Sam Altman)對於公司可能成為Anthropic的陪襯，淪為行業老二的説法，不以為然。奧特曼周一參加了Semafor「矽谷與世界」大會的現場訪談，當被問及OpenAI會不會像當年Lyft被Uber壓制那樣，競爭不過Anthropic時，他回答説，「這沒什麼好擔心的」，引發了現場觀眾一陣笑聲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586720.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.950087+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:11:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"f06da779591a1ff149554a6bc92b4905a77cfcfab80818847492d7c457494695","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}